    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0221",
      "reading_order": 284,
      "section": "1-1. Head Stock",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 673.8748519999999,
        "r": 442.71009599999985,
        "b": 665.0031329281768
      },
      "content": "Ensures the wide-range change in speed by the AC spindle motor as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0222",
      "reading_order": 285,
      "section": "1-1. Head Stock",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 656.89496,
        "r": 520.259885999999,
        "b": 631.0433489281769
      },
      "content": "For SUPER KIATURN 100, between 30 and 6.000 rpm and for SUPER KIATURN 200, between 30 and 4.000 rpm."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0223",
      "reading_order": 286,
      "section": "1-1. Head Stock",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 622.875056,
        "r": 453.76415999999983,
        "b": 614.0033369281769
      },
      "content": "Besides, it enables the constant surface speed control by the AC spindle motor."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0224",
      "reading_order": 287,
      "section": "1-2. Tool Post",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.91999999999999,
        "t": 588.9152720000001,
        "r": 147.674202,
        "b": 580.043552928177
      },
      "content": "1-2. Tool Post",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0225",
      "reading_order": 288,
      "section": "1-2. Tool Post",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964599999998,
        "t": 554.8953680000001,
        "r": 520.1847360000006,
        "b": 529.043756928177
      },
      "content": "Ensures more rapid and accurate indexing work (0,12 sec/surface) by the servo motor and the 3-pice coupling."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0226",
      "reading_order": 289,
      "section": "1-3. Tail Stock (Option)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.92,
