        "r": 191.07984000000002,
        "b": 495.0238529281769
      },
      "content": "1-3. Tail Stock (Option)",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0227",
      "reading_order": 290,
      "section": "1-3. Tail Stock (Option)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 469.87566800000013,
        "r": 373.19334000000015,
        "b": 461.0039489281769
      },
      "content": "Install the taper of MT No. 4 sold as a commercial live center."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0228",
      "reading_order": 291,
      "section": "1-3. Tail Stock (Option)",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 452.8957760000001,
        "r": 520.1957580000013,
        "b": 410.0041529281769
      },
      "content": "The tail stock is set to random position by controlling the key above the support. Also, the thrust can  be  adjusted  between  50  and  450  Kgf  (500N  and  4.500N)  according  to  the  hydraulic adjustment."
    }
